---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import logoImage from '../assets/EDO logo_ESSENCE Design Office Logo Yoko.svg';
---

<footer class="mt-8 border-t-[0.8px] border-text-2 bg-white px-4 pb-12 pt-8 text-neutral md:px-8 lg:px-12">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.15fr)_minmax(0,0.85fr)_minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.35fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-8 [&>*]:min-w-0">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm">神奈川県川崎市のWeb制作・広報支援</p>
      <a href="/" class="mt-4 inline-block">
        <Image src={logoImage} alt="ESSENCE Design Officeのロゴ" class="h-10 w-auto md:h-12" />
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">営業時間：9時－18時（土日祝休）</p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="サイト内">
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/about" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#works" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">制作工程・実績</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#flow" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">制作の流れ</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#price" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">料金について</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#voice" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">お客様の声</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#faq" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="/news" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">お知らせ</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <nav aria-label="関連リンク">
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li>
          <a href="https://portfolio-fujitasayaka.studio.site/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">Portfolio</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/essence_design_office/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">Instagram</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://note.com/essence_design_o" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">note</a>
        </li>
        <li><a href="/security" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">情報基本方針</a></li>
        <li><a href="/policy" class="inline-block transform transition duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:text-accent">個人情報保護方針</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 p-4 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-h2">
        どうぞお気軽に<br />ご相談ください
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body">
        ひとまずご相談でも大歓迎です。お打合せで、Webでやりたいこと、あなたのビジネスの状況について教えてください。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-contact w-full max-w-[353px]">お問い合わせ</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-6xl text-caption text-neutral-500 md:text-right">
    © ESSENCE Design Office. All Rights Reserved.
  </p>
</footer>
